<title>USA: PDG Environmental names new director.</title>
<headline>PDG Environmental names new director.</headline>
<dateline>MONROEVILLE, Pa. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PDG Environmental Inc said Tuesday that it has appointed Noxso Corp President and Chief Executive Edwin Kilpela to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Noxso in February, Kilpela was general manager of Westinghouse Electric Corp's environmental services division and, more recently, president of Ansaldo Ross Hill, a power electronics firm in Houston.</p>
<p>PDG provides asbestos abatement and related services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
